  <data name="Guide_WelcomeTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Welcome to CamelPlayer</value></data>
  <data name="Guide_Welcome" xml:space="preserve"><value>Two quick steps: choose where your music is, then how CamelPlayer plays it. You can skip and change both later in Settings.</value></data>
  <data name="Guide_FoldersTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Add your music folders</value></data>
  <data name="Guide_Folders" xml:space="preserve"><value>Add as many folders as you like, on this computer or a NAS. CamelPlayer builds the library in the background.</value></data>
  <data name="Guide_OutputTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Choose the output</value></data>
  <data name="Guide_Output" xml:space="preserve"><value>WASAPI following the Windows default device works everywhere. Pick ASIO or Kernel Streaming, or a fixed device, for your DAC.</value></data>
